{"id":"n34923-3-7","stage":2,"title":"구멍 · 漏洞","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n34923-3-7-1","ko":"다들 잘하는데 딱 한 명이 문제구나.","zh":"大家都表现不错，就只有一个人有问题啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다들","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘하는데","meaning":"棒","explanation":"잘하다：棒；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"딱","meaning":"正好，正","explanation":"딱：正好，正","readings":[{"term":"딱","audio":"/audio/c2f17f436a9934a6c4b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50537","senseId":"3","lemma":"딱","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个","explanation":"한：一个","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"2","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"명이","meaning":"个，名","explanation":"명：个，名；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"명","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70812","senseId":"1","lemma":"명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"문제구나.","meaning":"难题，问题","explanation":"문제：难题，问题；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"3","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"棒","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"做得好、优秀。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]},{"id":"c2f17f436a9934a6","term":"딱","zh":"正好，正","audio":"/audio/c2f17f436a9934a6c4b5.mp3","entryId":"50537","definition":"数量、大小、情况等正确无误的样子。","pronunciation":["딱"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一个","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"多个中的一个。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"9f96b8e22cc06bfa","term":"명","zh":"个，名","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3","entryId":"70812","definition":"计算人数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["명"]},{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"难题，问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"为难或难以解决的事情。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]}],"audio":"/audio/a650a4cdd8e7db9e86d8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n34923-3-7-2","ko":"걔가 원래 우리 팀의 구멍이에요.","zh":"他本来就是我们团队的弱项。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"걔가","meaning":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","explanation":"걔：“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"걔","audio":"/audio/6488cd1503b8fc1cb5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64369","senseId":"1","lemma":"걔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"원래","meaning":"原来，本来","explanation":"원래：原来，本来","readings":[{"term":"원래","audio":"/audio/dc5331dd64d187d4a0fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53768","senseId":"1","lemma":"원래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"팀의","meaning":"组，小组，团队","explanation":"팀：组，小组，团队；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"팀","audio":"/audio/321639b7ad86dc7655c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20274","senseId":"1","lemma":"팀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구멍이에요.","meaning":"漏洞，亏空","explanation":"구멍：漏洞，亏空；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"구멍","audio":"/audio/bdf45aec9d9cea46cc2f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34923","senseId":"3","lemma":"구멍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6488cd1503b8fc1c","term":"걔","zh":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/6488cd1503b8fc1cb5fa.mp3","entryId":"64369","definition":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"dc5331dd64d187d4","term":"원래","zh":"原来，本来","audio":"/audio/dc5331dd64d187d4a0fd.mp3","entryId":"53768","definition":"从一开始；或指从根本上。","pronunciation":["월래"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"321639b7ad86dc76","term":"팀","zh":"组，小组，团队","audio":"/audio/321639b7ad86dc7655c3.mp3","entryId":"20274","definition":"共事的一群人。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"bdf45aec9d9cea46","term":"구멍","zh":"漏洞，亏空","audio":"/audio/bdf45aec9d9cea46cc2f.mp3","entryId":"34923","definition":"(喻义)缺陷或弱点。","pronunciation":["구멍"]}],"audio":"/audio/85d6302b782e8ee27cf6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.402,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=34923","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":73,"sequenceScore":1.9996,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["他本来就是我们团队的弱项。","智秀，伯母们都在哪儿呢？","大家都表现不错，就只有一个人有问题啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["他本来就是我们团队的弱项。","大家都表现不错，就只有一个人有问题啊。","智秀，伯母们都在哪儿呢？"],"answer":0}]}
